  "flow_summary": "The interviewer was patient and persistent in guiding a difficult, confused persona through a long intake. However, the system struggled significantly with the PHQ-9 and GAD-7 sections, repeatedly failing to maintain the context of the questionnaire and forcing the patient to ask for the list of options multiple times. The system also failed to follow the requirement to ask each PHQ-9 and GAD-7 item exactly once, as it frequently re-asked questions due to the patient's confusion.",
