    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "category": "questionnaire_management",
      "evidence": "The interviewer repeatedly re-asked PHQ-9 and GAD-7 questions (e.g., 'PHQ-9 Question 3: During the last two weeks, how often have you had trouble falling or staying asleep, or sleeping too much?' was asked three times) rather than effectively managing the patient's confusion."
